---
description: Database schema and invariants (never reuse codes)
globs: ["db/**", "backend/**/migrations/**", "**/*alembic*", "**/*prisma*"]
alwaysApply: false
---

## Tables (minimum)
- short_links:
  - code (unique, case-sensitive)
  - original_url
  - tag_id
  - expires_at (nullable)
  - created_at
  - note (nullable)
  - status (active/disabled/blocked)

- tags:
  - id
  - name (unique)
  - is_active

- reserved_codes:
  - code (primary key)
  - reason
  - type (blocked/reserved)
  - created_at

## Invariants
- A code can NEVER be reused: do not delete short_links rows; do not allow creating if code exists historically.
- Reserved codes cannot be created or redirected.

## Indexes
- Unique index on short_links.code
- Index on tag_id, created_at
- Optional: trigram or full-text index for searching original_url
